While two_weaponing, the only skill you are exercising is your 
two-weapon skill. Wielding the knife as your primary weapon by 
itself will exercise your knife skill.  I don't know all the 
specifics, but if you want the most punch out of your Mojo / 
Crysknife combo, it would definitely be worth #enchancing your 
knife skill to at least the level of your war hammer skill.

#two_weaponing is very powerful, especially with the right 
weapons.  There is not clear cut answer, but generally it is 
beneficial to dual wield.  You might forgo it for a shield 
(especially a shiny shield) or for style, but for straight 
damage, #two_weaponing usually comes out on top. Note that as 
your XPlevel increases to 14 and beyond, you gain very healthy 
+modifiers to your To Hit chance.

